e return the connection status of app in b control.false means app in b control lost control.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getRcBAppOnline</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Return the connection status of App in B control.false means App in B control lost control.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">No matching members. Try a shorter keyword.</div></div>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_remotecontroller_struct_rcmultistatusmsg_getrcaonline\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_remotecontroller_struct_rcmultistatusmsg_getrcaonline_inline\">getRcAOnline</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_remotecontroller_struct_rcmultistatusmsg_getrcaonline_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getRcAOnline</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getRcAOnline</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">corp.sdk.keyvalue.value.remotecontroller</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Return A control connection status. <code>false</code> means A control lost control. The possible reason is that A control is turned off or loses connection with the aircraft.</font></p