h>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">Boolean</font></code></td><td>true means that App in A control is connected.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_remotecontroller_struct_rcmultistatusmsg_getrcbonline\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_remotecontroller_struct_rcmultistatusmsg_getrcbonline_inline\">getRcBOnline</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_remotecontroller_struct_rcmultistatusmsg_getrcbonline_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getRcBOnline</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getRcBOnline</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">corp.sdk.keyvalue.value.remotecontroller</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Return B control connection status.<code>false</code> means B control lost control. The possible reason is that B control is not connected to the frequency, turns off or loses connection with the aircraft.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">Boolean</font></code></td><td>true means that